Community Online Tools (COT), by Jacob_Mango and contributors
  ReCON-Mod's heal action and its weather and time controls are modelled
  on how COT does them (making an invulnerable player vulnerable while
  healing, ending illness symptoms and waking a knocked-out player; the
  three weather modes and freezing time). They were written for ReCON-Mod
  using DayZ's own script API; no COT code is copied. COT is licensed under
  Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0).
